[39.579321, "o", "{\r\n  \"id\": \"OPS-2288\",\r\n  \"severity\": \"info\",\r\n  \"published_at\": \"2026-11-10T08:00:00Z\",\r\n  \"title\": \"Maintenance window 2026-11-29\",\r\n  \"body\": \"The delta API is read-only on 2026-11-29 between 01:00 and 03:00 UTC. Cursors issued before the window stay valid; clients should retry with backoff.\"\r\n}\r\n{\r\n  \"id\": \"OPS-2291\",\r\n  \"severity\": \"action_required\",\r\n  \"published_at\": \"2026-11-18T06:30:00Z\",\r\n  \"title\": \"Schema v2.3: integrator action required - expired local price overrides\",\r\n  \"body\": \"Schema v2.3 (feed epoch 2026.47) re-issues retired SKU codes within the epoch. Integrators must remove expired local price overrides (rows whose end date has passed) from their override tables before applying v2.3 deltas: expired rows are re-evaluated against re-issued codes during apply and cause effective-price drift. Remove them once per integration, e.g. DELETE FROM price_overrides WHERE ends_on < date('now'). Integrations that keep expired overrides are out of contract for MAP pricing from 2026-11-25 (Integrator A"]
[39.579361, "o", "greement s4.2).\"\r\n}\r\n"]
